  Description: As a formally trained apothecary or a rural practitioner of folk medicine,
    you learned the healing properties of various herbs. You're adept at collecting
    the right natural cures in all sorts of environments and preparing them properly.
    Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution or Wisdom , and one
    is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Nature skill and the Herbalism
    Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Natural Medicine]
    skill feat.
